The regression is caused by the removal of key classes (`Base64JavaUtilCodec`, `LambdaMapper`) in the downgrade from XStream 1.4.15 to 1.4.14-java7. The `Base64JavaUtilCodec` class, which is critical for Base64 encoding/decoding, is entirely removed in the target version. The `LambdaMapper` class, which handles Lambda expressions, is also removed. These removals disrupt functionality that was present in the baseline version, leading to test failures.

